{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:318655cea4bd2096","name":"Languages","source":{"id":"source:reference-318655cea4bd2096","title":"Languages","revision":23024,"timestamp":"2024-09-14T19:05:51Z","sha256":"5ea4634b2d424b7cfb5c4e8cbf16858a8338031acc501cf6bffbd2d43ca60c65","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=23024","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Languages&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-318655cea4bd2096","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The primary Language used throughout known space is called Basic. Most characters can speak Basic, and all characters understand it even if they can't speak it. Nonhuman characters can also speak, read, and write the Language associated with their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"},"; for example, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bothans"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bothans"}," speak, read, and write Bothese as well as Basic. Characters with an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intelligence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intelligence"}," bonus know how to speak, read, and write other Languages as well. For each point of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intelligence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intelligence"}," bonus, a character can speak, read, and write one additional Language of their choice.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Some ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Gamorreans"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gamorreans"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiees"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiees"},", for example) are incapable of speaking any other Language other than their native tongue, but they can learn to read and write other Languages just fine.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Common Languages"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Star Wars "]},"galaxy is home to millions of Languages but picking Languages for your character doesn't need to be daunting. A few of the most common languages are listed below. Among these, Basic is the most widely spoken. Other prevalent languages include Huttese (particularly common in ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Outer Rim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Outer_Rim?action=edit&redlink=1"},"), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Binary"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Binary","referenceId":"reference:ee1c8277caf5fb9b"}," (used by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," and programmers), and Bocce (a trade language that can be spoken by almost any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"},").\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":["Basic"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Binary"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Binary","referenceId":"reference:ee1c8277caf5fb9b"}]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Bocce"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Bothese"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Cerean"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Dosh"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Durese"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Ewokese*"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Gamorrean"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Gunganese*"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["High Galactic"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Huttese"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Ithorese"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Jawa Trade Language*"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Kel Dor"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Mon Calamarian"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Quarrenese"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Rodese"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Ryl"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Shyriiwook"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Sullustese"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Zabrak"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["*Local language not widely spoken except on its planet of origin."]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Old Republic Languages"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["In addition to the languages described in Common Languages, Arkanian and Snivvian are considered common Languages in the galaxy during ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Old Republic Era"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Old_Republic_Era"},". Other Languages might be more common in specific regions of the galaxy. For instance, ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Mandalorians"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Mandalorians","referenceId":"reference:b7f4f8a44de3a6c8"}," bring Mando'a to the worlds they conquer. Except for the earliest period of the original Sith Empire, ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith","referenceId":"reference:32bde5e69837ac8e"}," of this era rely on Basic and their own native languages rather than any common Sith tongue.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Fringe Languages"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":["Old Corellian is the original language spoken by the people of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Corellia"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Corellia","referenceId":"reference:b23d752dcc50dee4"}," before that world joined the Republic and adopted Basic as the standard language. Though few actually speak Old Corellian these days, the Language is far from dead, and many Corellians still pepper their speech with Old Corellian phrases."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Socorran is the language spoken by the natives of the volcanic desert world of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Socorro"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Socorro","referenceId":"reference:af5f5e0f527bb7df"},". Like Old Corellian, Socorran has largely been supplanted by Basic, but many pirates, smugglers, and other criminals use it as a secret language known only to those who have spent time on the seedy world. "]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Sy Bisti is a trade language spoken on ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Outer Rim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Outer_Rim?action=edit&redlink=1"}," and also in parts of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Unknown Regions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Unknown_Regions"},". Though the language is not as widespread as Bocce, many inhabitants of worlds on the edge of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Unknown Regions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Unknown_Regions"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wild Space"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wild_Space?action=edit&redlink=1"}," use Sy Bisti as a common language between ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"}," that have not learned Basic."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Unknown Regions Languages"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Although ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Unknown Regions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Unknown_Regions"}," have no widespread common language such as Basic, several Languages are regularly used among specific nomadic groups and within some systems and regions. Trade languages are commonly used to bridge the formidable language gap. When creating a character native to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Unknown Regions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Unknown_Regions"},", you can select a Language from the following list, with your Gamemaster's approval. When selecting a new language for an existing character from known space, your character might be able to learn one of these Languages, with Gamemaster approval.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":["Altirish*"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Anzat*"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Anarrese*"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Dromnyr*"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Chadra-Fan*"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Cheunh*"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Ebruchese*"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Killik*"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Kreva"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Minnisiat (Trade Language)"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Nikto"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Rakata**"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Rammocate (Trade Language)"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Shistavanen*"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Sluissese*"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Squibbian*"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Ssi-Ruuvi*"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Sy Bisti (Trade Language)"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Tibranese*"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Tof*"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Vagaari*"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Verpine*"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["*Local language not widely spoken except on its planet or in its nomadic group of origin."]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["**Widely spoken during ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Pre-Republic Era"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Pre-Republic_Era?action=edit&redlink=1"},", locally spoken in all other eras."]},"\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
